---
description: Apply the shared global instructions and advisor baseline across all workspaces
alwaysApply: true
---

Follow the shared instructions in `~/.agents/instructions/global.md`. If they are unavailable, say so rather than inventing or duplicating them.

Load optional modules when the task requires them:
- `~/.agents/modules/brain.md`: saving context to the brain repositories.
- `~/.agents/modules/conventions.md`: worktrees, Markdown, shell, Node, tmux.

For Cursor-wide behavior, ensure this is set under Cursor Settings → Rules for AI / User Rules:
`Follow the shared instructions in ~/.agents/instructions/global.md. If they are unavailable, say so rather than duplicating them.`
